<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Daniel Jiménez — Desarrollo web para pequeños negocios</title>
</head>
<body style="
  margin: 0;
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background-color: #f5f5f0;
  font-family: Georgia, serif;
  color: #1a1a1a;
">
  <main style="text-align: center; padding: 2rem;">
    <p style="
      margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #888;
    ">Próximamente</p>

    <h1 style="
      margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
      font-weight: normal;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      line-height: 1.1;
    ">Daniel Jiménez</h1>

    <p style="
      margin: 0 0 2.5rem 0;
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: #555;
      font-style: italic;
    ">Desarrollo web para pequeños negocios</p>

    <div style="
      width: 40px;
      height: 1px;
      background-color: #1a1a1a;
      margin: 0 auto;
    "></div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>